      "parent": "B60T8/1755",
      "ja": "｛車両の前後方軸周りの安定性を高めることに特に適合するもの，すなわち．横転防止（特定のサブユニットの制御以外の方法による横転防止のための路面車両の走行制御方式Ｂ６０Ｗ３０／０４）｝",
      "en": "{specially adapted for enhancing stability around the vehicles longitudinal axle, i.e. roll-over prevention (road vehicle drive control systems for roll-over prevention otherwise than by controlling a particular sub-unit B60W30/04)}",
